{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939010/extras/05b157a3cb7c0eaf018e849541eeaf47.poster.avif?t=1759528841\" aria-label=\"Gameplay\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939010/extras/05b157a3cb7c0eaf018e849541eeaf47.webm?t=1759528841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939010/extras/05b157a3cb7c0eaf018e849541eeaf47.mp4?t=1759528841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B-Line is a <strong>first-person</strong>\u00a0<strong>knowledge-based</strong>\u00a0<strong>walking simulator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the <strong>B-Line subway</strong> and <strong>freely explore</strong> <strong>multiple</strong>\u00a0<strong>worlds </strong>with<strong> different atmospheres</strong>\u00a0to find out how to <strong>escape the station</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939010/extras/3441b95efb04ccd4cf84b3107ed44a92.poster.avif?t=1759528841\" aria-label=\"Features\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939010/extras/3441b95efb04ccd4cf84b3107ed44a92.webm?t=1759528841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939010/extras/3441b95efb04ccd4cf84b3107ed44a92.mp4?t=1759528841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playtime of <strong>around 3 hours</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong>, which may hide some surprises...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can\u00a0be\u00a0played\u00a0with\u00a0<strong>a mouse and keyboard</strong>, or with <strong>a</strong>\u00a0<strong>controller</strong>.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939010/d621a31bcbb0c25ede39e5cf15495d35ee5a1065.jpg"},{"name":"The Call","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939010/e7a8fa391036fa1a5531fb9bb9d4b219ce153fae.jpg"},{"name":"City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939010/14502525b91247db539c968ee7694531ac850922.jpg"},{"name":"Planetary Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939010/e4742904e5e551ad858e9bdde26ac06c43390e1f.jpg"},{"name":"Companion Sphere","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939010/b12a52f3ea6815a9198cea047806b5f625e39b62.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Painting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939010/40c7b068e9ec8d9f5b5627da64c602b6ed469ad7.jpg"},{"name":"Homebody","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939010/08313ce7fb5754ddefd3ab0562b96e50a3b78c1f.jpg"},{"name":"Deadline","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939010/7bd6beb80de878d955faac094ebdada1ca304bbd.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939010?t=1759528841","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939010?t=1759528841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939010/19133ce5fe33cc0e5730cdbc5c04aea89ec62cb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759528841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/39390